{"title":"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Set\" title=\"Set\">set</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7bf42db84e4d2dbb7bf55476c12bf9f6233bc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be a 90-<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Element\" title=\"Element\">element</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Subset\" title=\"Subset\">subset</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1243072101629687a231c6875b5571d42bedbb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,100\\},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> be the sum of the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c689c74dd017fde092378707ac34497962a881.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{A}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> Find the number of possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/7/0d7e49ad93a99ed6dcafd1c6acba511a181ab6a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/6/536ee4f27d4e3f1b2d6821af3a54f047526cb98f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+ \\ldots +90 = 91 \\cdot 45 = 4095$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"257\" height=\"14\" />. The largest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82ff3fe9096d9fb04e40678fba2c34325989a589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11+12+ \\ldots +100=111\\cdot 45=4995$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"294\" height=\"14\" />. All numbers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6c271890b861ca1960967e767057d851521105c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4095$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d0df43a65b121eb4ea863be11da6a7ae5fb1f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4995$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> are possible values of S, so the number of possible values of S is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/6/80652b602bb15cb9edc8927af02d670fe900905e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4995-4095+1=\\boxed{901}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"191\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>Alternatively, for ease of calculation, let set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382cea990fadd43376cf42e8e0597a5eb13a67c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> be a 10-element subset of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/7912cff3e3d7b86472a4a04d4060419750b0b79d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,\\ldots,100\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"128\" height=\"18\" />, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be the sum of the elements of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382cea990fadd43376cf42e8e0597a5eb13a67c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" />. Note that the number of possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> is the number of possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1da1c31c45b0686a6e997c2936a964a95dea3ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T=5050-S$\" width=\"108\" height=\"12\" />. The smallest possible <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b12e281ba65332a3b784d95506dbe6a815b0a66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+ \\ldots +10 = 55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"166\" height=\"14\" /> and the largest is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d65fb3304059477860cc3dafaeba8272daf7432b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91+92+ \\ldots + 100 = 955$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"202\" height=\"14\" />, so the number of possible values of T, and therefore S, is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a202eed17d8748f6f8affdfd47d0003824b6f4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$955-55+1=\\boxed{901}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"164\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I\" title=\"2006 AIME I\">2006 AIME I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AIME I Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AIME_I_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AIME I Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNew